padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;IT&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;1. Per ciascuna entità (Product, Region, Sales) indicare l&#39;attributo chiave e i principali attributi descrittivi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;IT&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;2. Descrivere la cardinalità delle relazioni Product-Sales e Region-Sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;IT&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;3. Rappresentare le gerarchie: Product include Category, Region include State.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
